<title>UK: London fertiliser fixtures.</title>
<headline>London fertiliser fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>TBN 23,000 tonnes fertiliser Jubail/Necochea and Rosario $18 fio 4,500 shex/2,500 shex 20-30/3 ICEC.</p>
<p>TBN - 20,000 tonnes fertiliser USG/three ports Peru $23 fio 8,000 shinc/2,000 shinc 15-25/3 Conagra.</p>
